<!DOCTYPE DM SYSTEM>
<!-- Help panel for the ISPF Primary Option Menu. Shown on PF1; PF3 returns.
     Auto-flow (ISPDTLC-idiomatic): no row/col; the title centres itself and the
     conversion utility spaces the blocks. The option grid is a preformatted
     <lines> block so its columns line up. -->
<panel name="ispfhelp">ISPF Primary Option Menu - HELP
  <info>
    <p>The Primary Option Menu is the top of the ISPF dialog hierarchy.</p>

    <p>Type an option number on the Option ===> line and press ENTER to select it.</p>
    <lines>
0  Settings      1  View          2  Edit          3  Utilities
4  Foreground    5  Batch         6  Command       7  Dialog Test
</lines>

    <p>Enter X (or press PF3) on the Option line to exit ISPF and log off.</p>
  </info>

  <botinst>PF3=Return</botinst>

  <keyl name="HELPKEYS">
    <keyi key="PF3"  cmd="EXIT">Return</keyi>
    <keyi key="PF15" cmd="EXIT">Return</keyi>
  </keyl>
</panel>
